---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Window Cleaning Services Phoenix AZ | Diaz Cleaning LLC"
  description="Professional interior & exterior window cleaning in Phoenix, AZ. Streak-free results for homes and businesses. Call (480) 479-4507."
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Window Cleaning Services in Phoenix, AZ</h1>
      <p class="service-subtitle">Crystal-clear windows for homes and businesses across Phoenix and the Valley.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>

    <section class="service-content">
      <h2>Professional Window Cleaning in Phoenix</h2>
      <p>Dirty windows affect the appearance of your home or business and block natural light. Diaz Cleaning LLC provides professional streak-free window cleaning for residential and commercial properties throughout Phoenix, AZ.</p>

      <h2>Window Cleaning Services Include:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Interior window cleaning</li>
        <li>Exterior window cleaning</li>
        <li>Screen cleaning and reinstallation</li>
        <li>Frame and sill wiping</li>
        <li>High-rise and multi-story windows</li>
        <li>Storefront glass cleaning</li>
        <li>Post-construction window cleaning</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why Clean Windows Matter in Phoenix</h2>
      <p>Phoenix's desert climate means dust, pollen and hard water deposits build up fast on windows. Regular professional window cleaning protects your glass from permanent etching and keeps your property looking its best year-round.</p>

      <h2>Serving Phoenix and Surrounding Cities</h2>
      <p>We provide window cleaning services throughout Phoenix, Glendale, Scottsdale, Tempe, Mesa, Chandler, Peoria, Surprise, Avondale and Goodyear. Contact us today for a free estimate.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Get Streak-Free Windows Today</h2>
      <p>Call us at <a href="tel:+14804794507">(480) 479-4507</a> or send us a message for a free window cleaning estimate.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-primary">Book Now</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .service-page {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    font-family: 'Mulish', sans-serif;
  }
  .service-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }
  .service-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #4a1060;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .service-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .service-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #4a1060;
    margin: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }
  .service-content p {
    color: #444;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .service-content ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .service-content ul li {
    padding: 0.5rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    color: #444;
  }
  .service-content ul li::before {
    content: "✓";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #9b308a;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .service-cta {
    text-align: center;
    background: #f8f0fc;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 3rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }
  .service-cta h2 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    color: #4a1060;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .service-cta p {
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] {
    color: #9b308a;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #9b308a;
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: background 0.3s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { background: #4a1060; }
</style>